<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 143 0 R
/T (The digital landscape for architectural and interior design firms relies heavily on high-fidelity visual communication. Clients expect to see high-resolution imagery, seamless spatial transformations, and transparent pricing structures before committing to premium services. "Dreamspace Interior Design & Home" is an engineering-driven Progressive Web Application \(PWA\) developed to provide users with an immersive, highly accessible, and exceptionally high-performance platform for interacting with interior design solutions.)
/E (The digital landscape for architectural and interior design firms relies heavily on high-fidelity visual communication. Clients expect to see high-resolution imagery, seamless spatial transformations, and transparent pricing structures before committing to premium services. "Dreamspace Interior Design & Home" is an engineering-driven Progressive Web Application \(PWA\) developed to provide users with an immersive, highly accessible, and exceptionally high-performance platform for interacting with interior design solutions.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
390 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 143 0 R
/T (Once the shell is loaded, the application provides seamless, single-page-like transitions between various functional modules. These modules include an interactive, real-time cost estimator driven by mathematical DOM manipulation, a brand-centric dashboard, and a highly interactive "Material Spotlight" philosophy section. The result is a platform that feels and operates identically to a native iOS or Android application, complete with home-screen installation capabilities, without the traditional friction of app store distribution.)
/E (Once the shell is loaded, the application provides seamless, single-page-like transitions between various functional modules. These modules include an interactive, real-time cost estimator driven by mathematical DOM manipulation, a brand-centric dashboard, and a highly interactive "Material Spotlight" philosophy section. The result is a platform that feels and operates identically to a native iOS or Android application, complete with home-screen installation capabilities, without the traditional friction of app store distribution.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
