/P 144 0 R
/T (By transitioning to a Progressive Web App structure, Dreamspace leverages local device caching and intelligent background storage. This ensures that the heavy visual assets required to market luxury interior design do not compromise software performance, responsiveness, or user retention metrics, thereby increasing overall client engagement.)
/E (By transitioning to a Progressive Web App structure, Dreamspace leverages local device caching and intelligent background storage. This ensures that the heavy visual assets required to market luxury interior design do not compromise software performance, responsiveness, or user retention metrics, thereby increasing overall client engagement.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
398 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 144 0 R
/T (App-Like User Experience \(UX\): Deliver a seamless, installable user experience that bridges the gap between web and native platforms. Users must be able to install the application to their home screen directly from the browser context without navigating complex app store approvals or downloading large, monolithic application files.)
/E (App-Like User Experience \(UX\): Deliver a seamless, installable user experience that bridges the gap between web and native platforms. Users must be able to install the application to their home screen directly from the browser context without navigating complex app store approvals or downloading large, monolithic application files.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
399 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 144 0 R
/T (Offline Accessibility & Resilience: Implement robust Service Worker caching strategies \(specifically a Cache-First methodology for static assets\) to allow users to interact with previously loaded architectural assets, such as high-res room renderings and design philosophy cards, even under poor, degraded, or entirely disconnected network scenarios.)
/E (Offline Accessibility & Resilience: Implement robust Service Worker caching strategies \(specifically a Cache-First methodology for static assets\) to allow users to interact with previously loaded architectural assets, such as high-res room renderings and design philosophy cards, even under poor, degraded, or entirely disconnected network scenarios.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
