/E (Real-Time Algorithmic Calculation: Engineer a dynamic, DOM-manipulation-based Pricing Calculator. This tool must respond instantly to continuous user input via range sliders and interactive grid cards, performing cost multiplier mathematics entirely client-side to eliminate server-side rendering latency and unnecessary network payloads.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
