/E (The strict adherence to a premium design system, utilizing CSS custom property variables and glassmorphism techniques, ensures the platform visually communicates the luxury standards expected of the interior design industry, all while maintaining rigorous, Lighthouse-compliant software performance metrics underneath the interface. The Dreamspace platform serves as a viable, highly performant prototype for the future of digital architectural engagement.)
