/E (Backend Database Integration: Transitioning the currently simulated frontend authentication gateway and static data structures into a fully functional backend infrastructure utilizing MongoDB or PostgreSQL. This upgrade will allow user authentication sessions to persist securely using JSON Web Tokens \(JWT\), enabling clients to save their custom Cost Estimates and favorite portfolio imagery directly to a personalized account dashboard.)
