/E (Web Push Notifications API: Leveraging the Service Worker's extensive background capabilities to implement the native Web Push API. This will allow the design agency to send users direct mobile notifications regarding project milestone updates, new high-end material catalog drops, or consultation reminders, even when the browser tab is entirely closed.)
