/Title (During the operational `fetch` phase, the Service Worker intercepts every single outbound network request made by the browser. It implements a strict "Cache-First" retrieval protocol: it queries the local Cache Storage API first, and if a match is found, it serves the files directly from the device's hard drive, bypassing the network interface entirely.)
