/Title (Once the shell is loaded, the application provides seamless, single-page-like transitions between various functional modules. These modules include an interactive, real-time cost estimator driven by mathematical DOM manipulation, a brand-centric dashboard, and a highly interactive "Material Spotlight" philosophy section. The result is a platform that feels and operates identically to a native iOS or Android application, complete with home-screen installation capabilities, without the traditional friction of app store distribution.)
