/Title (Homeowners, renters, and commercial clients seeking premium interior design services frequently encounter severe digital friction when utilizing traditional architectural web platforms. Browsing image-heavy, high-definition architectural catalogs on constrained mobile networks results in high latency, visible layout shifts, and a degraded user experience. Furthermore, discovering and collaborating with designers often requires downloading bulky native applications, which consume significant device storage and present a major barrier to initial client acquisition. There is a critical, unaddressed need in the luxury architecture sector for a lightweight, cross-platform web solution that provides instantaneous access to design resources, reliable offline capabilities, and dynamic cost estimation tools without the overhead, friction, or update cycles of native app store installation.)
