/Title (As delineated in Figure 3.2, the user acts as the primary driver of the system. Critical use cases involve standard web interactions augmented by PWA capabilities. The unique capabilities, such as installing the application to the device's home screen and utilizing the platform in an offline state to browse cached portfolios, separate this architecture from traditional web models.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1860 0 R
/Prev 1880 0 R
>>
