/Title (Accessibility and Readability \(a11y\): The user interface must be designed to accommodate users with visual impairments. The contrast ratio between the primary text elements \(white\) and the dark glassmorphic panels \(charcoal\) must exceed the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines \(WCAG\) AA standards \(a contrast ratio of at least 4.5:1\). Furthermore, semantic HTML5 tags \(`)
