<<
/Title (The architecture is composed of three interconnected layers. The Presentation Tier handles rendering and physics calculations directly on the client's device. The PWA Interceptor Tier consists of the Service Worker \(`sw.js`\), which acts as an asynchronous background proxy determining whether to fetch data from the network or the local cache. Finally, the Application Server Tier utilizes Node.js and Express.js to host the static application assets securely over HTTP/HTTPS protocols.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
